# gamma Z0=50 mag_ang
; Hero 3 load-pull grid — a small constellation for the first loadpull gate.
; Gamma points (|G| < 1), magnitude then angle(degrees), normalized to Z0=50 ohm.
; Kept modest (21 points) so the 2-D sweep runs quickly and can be spot-checked.
; A future GUI grid-picker will generate finer/denser .gam files.

; --- center region (near the nominal 80+j10 load, G ~ 0.26 @ 35 deg) ---
0.00    0
0.20    0
0.20   90
0.20  180
0.20  270

; --- mid ring ---
0.40    0
0.40   45
0.40   90
0.40  135
0.40  180
0.40  225
0.40  270
0.40  315

; --- outer ring (closer to the unit circle — more reactive / higher-VSWR loads) ---
0.60    0
0.60   60
0.60  120
0.60  180
0.60  240
0.60  300

; --- one high-reflection point ---
0.80   30
